{{!
    @template local_pshub/course

    The public course page.

    WHAT IS NOT HERE, AND WHY
    The approved design also shows the teacher, the module plan, the next three
    live sessions with their remaining seats, the skills covered and the XP on
    offer. None of that exists in the data model yet - sessions land in S5,
    certificates in S14 - and inventing a teacher's name or a session date on
    the page a visitor is about to pay from is the one thing this page must
    never do. The sections appear when the data does.

    The call to action is whatever the gating service says the next click will
    do, so the button and the paywall can never disagree.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * course - A card context from catalogue_service::present(), plus summary.
    * catalogueurl - Back to the catalogue.
    * cta - {url, label, primary} or absent.
    * ctanote - A sentence under the button, or absent.
    * ctanotice - Rendered notification HTML (payment pending), or absent.
    * included - [{text}] what a place on this course carries.
    * sessions - [{title, when, duration}] the next dates, or none.
    * hassessions - bool

    Example context (json):
    {
        "catalogueurl": "/local/pshub/catalogue.php",
        "course": {"fullname": "Anglais conversation B1", "langplate": "EN", "cardtone": 1},
        "cta": {"url": "/login/index.php", "label": "Sign in to join", "primary": true},
        "included": [{"text": "50-minute live sessions"}]
    }
}}
<article class="ps-course">

    <nav class="ps-crumbs" aria-label="{{#str}}breadcrumb, local_pshub{{/str}}">
        <div class="ps-crumbs__inner">
            <a href="{{catalogueurl}}">{{#str}}catalogue, local_pshub{{/str}}</a>
            <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
            <span class="ps-crumbs__here">{{course.fullname}}</span>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <header class="ps-coursehead ps-coursehead--tone{{course.cardtone}}">
        <div class="ps-coursehead__inner">
            <span class="ps-coursehead__plate" aria-hidden="true">{{course.langplate}}</span>

            <div class="ps-coursehead__copy">
                {{#course.badges.0}}
                    <p class="ps-coursehead__badges">
                        {{#course.badges}}
                            <span class="ps-badge ps-badge--{{style}} ps-badge--inline">{{label}}</span>
                        {{/course.badges}}
                    </p>
                {{/course.badges.0}}

                <h1 class="ps-coursehead__title">{{course.fullname}}</h1>

                <p class="ps-coursehead__meta">
                    {{#course.cefr_level}}{{course.cefr_level}} · {{/course.cefr_level}}
                    {{#str}}card_duration, local_pshub, {{course.session_duration_minutes}}{{/str}}
                    {{#course.is_one_to_one}} · {{#str}}card_onetoone, local_pshub{{/str}}{{/course.is_one_to_one}}
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="ps-section">
        <div class="ps-section__inner ps-course__grid">

            <div class="ps-course__main">
                <h2 class="ps-course__h2">{{#str}}course_about, local_pshub{{/str}}</h2>
                <div class="ps-course__summary">{{{course.summary}}}</div>
            </div>

            {{#hassessions}}
                {{!
                    The dates, on the page where somebody decides whether to
                    pay. They are deciding whether they can be there on those
                    evenings, and a course that cannot say when it runs is
                    asking for money on trust.
                }}
                <section class="ps-course__dates">
                    <h2 class="ps-course__h2">{{#str}}course_dates, local_pshub{{/str}}</h2>
                    <ul class="ps-datelist">
                        {{#sessions}}
                            <li class="ps-dateitem">
                                <span class="ps-dateitem__when">{{when}}</span>
                                <span class="ps-dateitem__title">{{title}}</span>
                                <span class="ps-dateitem__meta">{{duration}}</span>
                            </li>
                        {{/sessions}}
                    </ul>
                </section>
            {{/hassessions}}

            <aside class="ps-course__aside">
                <div class="ps-pricecard">

                    <p class="ps-pricecard__price">
                        {{#course.isfree}}
                            <span class="ps-price-now ps-price-now--free">{{#str}}card_free, local_pshub{{/str}}</span>
                        {{/course.isfree}}
                        {{^course.isfree}}
                            {{#course.hasdiscount}}<span class="ps-price-was">{{course.pricebaseformatted}}</span>{{/course.hasdiscount}}
                            <span class="ps-price-now">{{course.priceformatted}}</span>
                        {{/course.isfree}}
                    </p>

                    {{#ctanotice}}<div class="ps-pricecard__notice">{{{ctanotice}}}</div>{{/ctanotice}}

                    {{#cta}}
                        <a class="ps-btn ps-btn--navy ps-pricecard__cta" href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a>
                    {{/cta}}

                    {{#ctanote}}<p class="ps-pricecard__note">{{ctanote}}</p>{{/ctanote}}

                    <ul class="ps-pricecard__list">
                        {{#included}}
                            <li>{{text}}</li>
                        {{/included}}
                    </ul>

                    {{^course.isfree}}
                        <div class="ps-pricecard__pay">
                            <span class="ps-pricecard__paylabel">{{#str}}course_pay_with, local_pshub{{/str}}</span>
                            <span class="ps-paytag">MTN MoMo</span>
                            <span class="ps-paytag">Orange Money</span>
                            <span class="ps-paytag">{{#str}}course_pay_card, local_pshub{{/str}}</span>
                            <p class="ps-pricecard__note">{{#str}}course_pay_note, local_pshub{{/str}}</p>
                        </div>
                    {{/course.isfree}}

                </div>
            </aside>

        </div>
    </div>
</article>
